{"hw":"θάσσων","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">θάσσων</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θάσσων</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θάττων</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> v. ταχύς. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θάτας:</span> <span class=\"gk\">θῆτας </span>(<span class=\"gk\">θύτας</span> cod.), <span class=\"gk\">τοὺς δούλους</span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Cypr.</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θατέρᾳ</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θάτερον</span>, v. ἕτερος.</div></div>"}